WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:36.700
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:40.370
My manager, Sagami Rei-kun,
is my former boyfriend.

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.990
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:44.410
I don't quite understand him.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:46.910
Mama, who just got done
writing a bombshell essay

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:47.710
called "My Daughter and I."

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:51.670
Kamura Naozumi-kun, a newly-appearing,
attractive, gifted young TV personality.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:52.750
It was Naozumi-kun that said to me...

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.090
I know your secret.

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:58.380
H- hold up!

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:06.480
"Heart-Pounding Twice Over"

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.690
Sana-chan, where are we going!

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:12.020
Just come with me!

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:13.360
Sana-chan!

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:17.030
Okay, Naozumi-kun...

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:20.370
What do you mean, you know my secret?

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:21.370
Well...

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:22.700
You don't mean...

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.370
You don't mean... That?

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:27.710
Yes. That.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.710
Ah! I've been revealed!

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.710
Okay, sure, I ate those two extra
fried shrimp bento lunches

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:33.630
while I was on location!

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.420
But listen! I have a
weakness for fried shrimp!

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:38.630
And as for the fried shrimps,
they have to love me!

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:41.010
It's better for both me,
who absolutely adores fried shrimp,

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.300
and for the fried shrimps,
who absolutely adore me,

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.810
if I eat a lot more of them,

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:46.390
--than for someone
who likes them only so-so to,
--No, that's not it...

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.310
if you ask me! Don't you think so?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.310
What? What? What? That's not it?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.650
No. It's...

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.650
Oh, no! Then, what!?
Huh? That? Is it that!?

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.320
Aah! You mean it!? You mean it!?
This is about that!?

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.320
It's not like that! When I ate all
the ice cream we were supposed to use

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.990
while we were shooting
that ice cream commercial,

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.160
and Uchiyamada-kun got blamed for it,

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.320
that was just something
that happened by accident!

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:05.790
After all, Uchiyamada-kun's stomach
got upset so quickly,

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:06.990
I just figured it would
work out okay for everyone.

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.000
But it wasn't my fault! I just simply...

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.330
...love to eat ice cream!

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.380
But it was one time!
Just that one time!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.670
Let it pass, okay!? See? I'm begging you!
Please, officer! Please, officer!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.340
It's not about food.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.010
I don't have any other secrets.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:25.010
It's about you and your Mama.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.970
"Who is this Naozumi-kun?"

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:32.980
I see. I guess it's not surprising
that someone would know about it.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.570
I heard it was on the news at the time.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:41.650
But Mama has written an essay about that,
and it's about to go on sale.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.990
Huh? It's being made into a book?

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.740
That's right! Next month, people
everywhere are going to know about it.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.660
It's no secret anymore.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.330
I- is that right?

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.670
So, what do you want?

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:57.000
Did you think you had
some kind of dirt on me!?

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.340
And what were you going
to do with it? Eh?

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.340
What were you planning
to threaten me into doing!?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:07.010
What were you after?
Money? Fame? Or was it...

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:07.680
What!?

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.520
Aah! What comes next is
too outrageous for me to say!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.350
What kind of person are you!?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.020
That's not it!

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:16.020
It's not that. I'm sorry.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.230
It's just... I would have missed you
if you had just said

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.030
"Okay, goodbye!" after work was over,

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:25.030
and I just... wanted, somehow,
to make an impression on you.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:30.040
But I didn't think about how to do it.
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.040
What kind of pose is that!?

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.290
Come off it!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.960
I like you, Sana-chan!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.960
Whoa! You like me!? Hey, how
can you say that so suddenly!?

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:39.300
Whoa! Did you just get caught up in
your momentum and profess your love!?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.960
Still, I can use this.
I'll make a memo of this.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.970
I know everything you've done
since you were 5, Sana-chan. Look!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:47.970
Where were you carrying that stuff?

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.470
"My Sana-chan"

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.470
Never mind the details, just look.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:53.980
What? Is this-- hey, is all of that
stuff articles and pictures about me?

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:57.650
Yes. I always carry these around with me.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:02.320
I also come see the plays that
Gekidan Komawari puts on each year.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:05.110
This year's is coming up soon, right?
I'm looking forward to it.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.990
I'm definitely going to go see it.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:10.660
Oh, so you do indeed like me, huh?
I get it! You're one of my fans!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.660
Well, I wouldn't say fan, exactly...

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.580
Well, then, if that's the case,
you should have said so sooner!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.330
For crying out loud,
I wasn't sure what to think!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.340
Just come to the point, already.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:24.340
Anyhow, I know everything about you.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.680
Everything? You mean, you...?

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.640
"W- what...?"

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:32.220
I'm a child who shares
the same past as you.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.270
The same...?

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.940
Naozumi! Where are you!?
We're going to be late

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.310
--for your next job!
--I have to go.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:42.980
Let's work together
again sometime, Sana-chan. Bye!

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.280
Ah, just a min--!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:45.650
Huh...?

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.360
He left.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.000
As long as she's dressed like this,
Sana is going to dance.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.960
♪ The quivering swan... ♪

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:59.330
♪ floats upon the water's surface... ♪

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.000
Kamura Naozumi...

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:06.760
What's the story with that boy, really?
He said he had the same past that I did.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.640
Well, I guess I'm not going to figure
that out just by thinking about it.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:14.680
Hold on... Kamura...?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.100
Mama, do you know something?

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.520
Perhaps. No, I'd better go check.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.360
I doubt there's anything in particular
to worry about, though.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.690
Until the book comes out, watch yourself.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.320
Right.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:31.370
Good morning, Sagami-san! Such fine
weather we're having again today!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.280
Sagami-san, is the sensei in there?

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:34.870
Sensei!

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.840
Until the book comes out, huh?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.630
Don't think about it!
Don't think about it!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.380
If I'm not able to figure it out
by thinking about it,

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.640
then I just won't figure it out!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.890
"Sana-chan sings"

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:56.970
♪ Thinking about it won't do any good! ♪

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.310
♪ Wasting energy by thinking
about it is like... ♪

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:00.980
♪ ...beating the air,
or watering the desert. ♪

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:02.980
♪ I'll let my precious head rest
as much as I can. ♪

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.320
♪ Relax, take it easy,
yakkity-yakkity, yadda-yadda. ♪

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.320
♪ When you're in a fix,
don't think about it! ♪

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.320
♪ When things are hard,
don't think about it! ♪

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:11.320
♪ If I don't think about it,
I don't worry! ♪

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:13.320
♪ And if I don't worry,
then I won't worry! ♪

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.830
♪ That makes everything feel better! ♪

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:20.330
All right! Now I don't
have anything on my mind!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:23.670
Clear! Reset! Okay, Sana-chan!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.000
What are you doing, Sagami-san?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.670
Oh, nothing. What about you, Onda-san?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.680
Ah, I came to pick up a manuscript.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.930
Editorial staff member Onda-san...!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.260
W- what?

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:37.600
You know the details of the next
book that is being published, right?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.230
I- I couldn't!

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:42.600
I'm not allowed to reveal the content
of anything until it is published!

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.270
"In that case, I'll make you talk"

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.610
Onda Takezo-san!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:47.940
Where do you hail from?

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.280
Higashimurayama.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.610
What is the first thing you do
when taking a bath?

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:54.280
Warm-up exercises.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:56.530
It says you have the personality
of an honest person

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.950
who is unable to keep secrets.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.290
It does, does it?

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:02.620
See? Little by little,
you're starting to want to tell me...

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.290
You can't hold out anymore...

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.290
Ah, hold on now...

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.340
Now, you want to tell me...
You want to let me know...

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.170
You want to start talking...

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:14.970
By Aoki Prize-winning author...
Kurata Misako...

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:19.640
Yes! Yes! That's it, that's it! Tell me!

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.640
Thunderboy comes down out of the sky,

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.980
seeking the belly buttons
of the townspeople,

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:24.980
and running around causing trouble.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.650
Not about to let their belly buttons
be taken from them,

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.650
the neighborhood association works hard
to try to run the boy out.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.280
Just then, the monster
Hesogomagon appears!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:36.620
Now, the neighborhood association and
Thunderboy have to team up to fight her!

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:39.950
Here, it's done.
"The Adventures of Thunderboy."

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.370
Right. Thank you very much, Sensei.
Nice work!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.960
Rats! Onda-san is in charge
of a different book!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.380
"Gekidan Komawari"

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:55.180
Rei-kun, what are you thinking about?

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:59.680
"If Sana-chan can get through whatever
problem she's facing right now,

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.640
then I think I should keep out of it."

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:02.520
"But as her manager,

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.310
I'm still concerned,
I'm still concerned..."

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.980
This guy is so easy to figure out.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:10.650
One-two, one-two,
more relaxed, okay, turn!

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:14.650
Something terrible might happen
once this book is published, and yet...

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.660
Sana-chan, you're twirling too much!

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:19.120
--...Sana-chan is twirling.
--Okay, lift your legs!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:23.330
Sensei told me to
look out for Sana-chan...

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.330
Eek! I think I'm going
to rupture my groin!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.670
Sana-chan is practicing
doing the splits.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:28.330
Sana-chan!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.880
--She fell!
--I'm fine! I'm fine!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.250
Even if my groin ruptures, or my
tushie splits, I will stick with this!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:35.260
Your tushie is split to begin with,
you know. I think...

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:39.600
Still, Sana-chan is trying
hard to get past something.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.720
"Elsewhere, what about Hayama???"

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.600
What do you want?

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.600
Is something wrong?

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.940
Sana-chan is working
as hard as she does...

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:50.310
If you love ice cream, I love you!

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.280
I wonder how much she's making.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.280
I don't know.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:01.620
Oh, someone's here. Akito, get the door.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.870
"What a pain..."

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:04.950
Thank you!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.960
"Summertime greetings!
Here's a watermelon for you!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.120
Hayama, how are you doing?

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:12.130
I'm sending you a ticket, so come see
the play we're putting on! --Sana."

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:14.960
"What a pain..."

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:18.300
--This doesn't really have
anything to do with me.
--Just go, would you?

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:21.300
It's only polite to thank someone
who gives you something, right?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:21.970
That's okay.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:24.720
Come on, don't be bashful, go!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:30.650
I said it was okay.
Damn, is she even home?

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:34.280
♪ One, two, three, yay!
Come on, one, two, three, yay! ♪

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:36.650
This is ringing, here...

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.910
Hey, this is ringing, here!

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.280
She said to ring her up
whenever I wanted to call her,

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.240
and now she's not answering.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:47.620
What's he doing here?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:52.630
♪ One, two, three, yay!
Come on, one, two, three, yay! ♪

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:55.300
Is that right? She's busy, huh?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.630
Yeah. That's probably
why she doesn't answer.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:59.630
In that case, I'm going home.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:00.930
Just a second...

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:04.600
Do you know anything
about Sana-chan's... er...

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:07.980
Do you know anything?

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.440
Your face says you don't.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:18.440
He's still a kid, and yet he can
already read an adult's face.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.780
Geez, you've got to be
careful around that guy.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.330
I got it! This is it! This is it!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.620
Huh? How come...?

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.660
Sana-chan, you're the one who did it.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.870
Tomorrow is the last day
of summer vacation,

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.670
and the day of the play!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.080
All right?!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:37.590
"Gekidan Komawari
Theatrical Presentation"

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:47.350
I'm at the headquarters
of Gekidan Komawari.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:50.100
The troupe is putting on
a stage production today.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.400
There are many patrons and members of
the press corps out in front of the hall.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.440
This has been the white bat, Babbit.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.730
My pretty student!

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:00.650
When Sana-chan is the
glorious staw of the stage,

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:04.990
I, Zenjiro, will not let anything stand
in the way of cheering for her!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:10.620
Hold on, now. Pitch-uhs? Oh my,
what is a poison to do in this position?

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:14.420
Whoa, just a minute. Let me strike
a decent pose for awl of you.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.090
There, how's this? Good pose, right?

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:18.960
It'll turn out fine-fine! Fine-fine!

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:24.760
Uh, hello? I'm Zenjiro here! I'm Zenjiro,
the guy who is on TV a lawt! Excuse me!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.760
I'm getting sick of this anime.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:31.810
Akito-kun, Principal Narunaru came,
and Zenjiro is here, too.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.770
Sana-chan must have invited
everyone she knows, huh?

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.740
What's going on?
Hey, Akito-kun, what's going on?

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:44.740
I don't know.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:47.410
Ah, it's that boy!
Hey, you know who that is?

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.080
That's the boy, Akito-kun!

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.410
The one Sana-chan co-starred
in that commercial with!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.660
Come to think of it,
I see him on TV a lot.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.750
His eyes are blue.
He looks half-western. How cool!

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:59.090
We're friends of Sana-chan!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:03.090
Yeah, is that right?
What is Sana-chan like at school?

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:05.090
What's she like? The same
as she is on TV, right?

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:06.760
Mm-hmm! Just like that.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.100
I knew it!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:11.890
Then again, maybe she acts
more child-like when she's on TV.

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:16.100
By the way, does Sana-chan have any boys
that she is good friends with?

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.100
She doesn't, does she?

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:21.780
L- let's see... She's been getting on
well with Hayama lately, huh?

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.780
Oh, right.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:24.780
Hayama?

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:25.780
Isn't that right?

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.780
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.120
Oh, that's him!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.450
Which one?

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:32.370
The one who's not the
kind-looking boy waving hello.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.710
Just between us,
she's even kissed him, huh?

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:35.710
Kissed him!?

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.040
Yep. More like she was kissed, though.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.380
You're kidding me...

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.750
Honest!

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:45.050
Ah, he's looking over at us
about something, Akito-kun.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.550
Huh? Akito-kun?

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.930
"Thump-thump"

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.390
Oh, I can't hear this thumping!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:53.720
Sana-chan, you seem to be
enjoying yourself even now.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:54.730
Aren't you nervous?

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:57.060
What are you talking about?
I'm totally nervous!

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.060
The stage is my reason for living!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.520
A live performance,
where outtakes are not allowed!

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:02.730
Oh, that's the stage for you!

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.530
The excitement and the
pounding of the heart!

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.070
Youth! This is the time of our youth!

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:09.070
Or maybe that was the grass-green age
we went through before adolescence!

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:12.700
Oh, I'm so nervous! A nervous summer!
A Japanese summer!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.660
"Sana"

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:18.080
Man, am I nervous, nervous!
What to do? Nervous, nervous...

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.750
Still, I think you should
relax a little bit.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:21.750
Y- you think so?

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.840
Mm-hmm. They say that drawing the
character for "person" on your palm

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.090
and then swallowing it works well.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:29.090
Oh, you mean swallowing a person!
I know it, I know it!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:32.050
Mama taught it to me once,
when Rei-kun was pretending to be sick.

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.390
"Person"... "Person"...
"Person"... "Person"...

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:37.730
Whew, that really does relax you.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.730
Oh no! Crap! I wrote
the character for "enter"!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:45.400
"Enter" "Person"

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.360
Yes, yes, the characters for "person"
and "enter" are often mistaken.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.730
Be careful, now!

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:49.410
Okay, ten minutes to curtain!
Has everyone gotten over their tension?

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:52.070
Yes... it's all under control...

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:55.080
Okay, everybody, let's break a leg!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:57.200
Everyone is still nervous.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.210
Anyhow, this week's Sana-chan!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.750
This says that the play is a story
about a faraway country a long time ago.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:09.130
It's the story of a girl named Eucie,

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:13.100
that took a stand to save her village
from an army that was oppressing them.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:16.140
Sana-chan will be playing
the part of this Eucie, right?

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:23.110
Akito-kun, that guy is coming this way.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.440
Hey there!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.360
Can I sit here?

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:30.150
Did you hear that? He spoke Japanese.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.030
I am Japanese.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:37.040
Oh, it's just that you
look half-western. Am I wrong?

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.370
I could be. I'm really
not sure about that.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:43.380
I hear that you're
good friends with Sana-chan.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.040
Yeah.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:47.670
I thought I knew everything
there was to know about Sana-chan,

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:51.380
but I didn't know she had
someone like you. I'm stunned.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.050
What's the story with this guy?
Huh, Hayama?

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:54.800
You know everything?

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:58.720
Then, do you know
about how much she makes?

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:03.600
Yeah, more or less.
Lately, the signing fee for her

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.520
just to do commercials
earns her eight figures.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.400
--E- eight figures!?
--E- eight figures!?

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.070
--Akito-kun, good grief!
--Akito-kun, good grief!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:12.740
Who are you!? Stop copying me!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.070
Make me!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:18.410
S- she makes that much? And she's
still just in elementary school?

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:21.410
That's an incredible amount,
for not even being with any agencies.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.420
Sana-chan's ability, and of course,

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.750
the power her astute
manager has, is strong.

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:26.750
Astute?

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:29.420
It means he's capable, Akito-kun.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.760
--You mean Sunglasses?
--Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:32.380
Hey, Kamura-kun!

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.050
You came, too! Thanks!

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:39.010
Whoa! That perverse Hayama
is here too, huh?

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.390
Good afternoon.

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:43.690
Hayama said hello to me!
On top of that, he even bowed!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.440
What's going on!! I'm shocked!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.400
It's starting.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:53.400
The children's division now presents their
production of "The Leaning Tower of V."

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:56.410
Please enjoy the performance
until it ends.

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:04.080
The army is coming again!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.080
My fields have been burned!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.750
I'm sick of this war!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:11.050
Yeah! It's always the weak
that become the casualties!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:13.090
My heart is pounding again!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.090
I've gotten nervous again
before going on!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:16.390
Are you okay, Sana-chan?

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:18.760
All this excitement feels great!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.760
♪ Heart-pounding invigoration!
Sana-chan's nervousness! ♪

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.720
♪ Hear-pounding invigoration!
Sana-chan's nervousness! ♪{checar}

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:24.730
♪ The pounding of my heart
is proof that I'm alive! ♪

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.770
♪ Frogs and crickets are alive, too! ♪

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.770
♪ The pounding is important,
the pounding of my heart. ♪

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:31.230
♪ Invigorating, invigorating,
nervousness, fun! ♪

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.490
All right, now to give it my all!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:43.040
It's time to eat, everyone!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.370
Eucie-sama! Eucie-sama!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:48.040
Amazing! Sana-chan just comes on,
and there's all this applause!

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:51.040
Sana-chan's got panache, all right.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.710
Yo, Sana-chan, you're Japan's greatest!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:54.380
Pipe down, Mister!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:58.050
Oh? What do you mean, "Mistah"?
I'm Zenjiro! The Zenjiro on TV!

00:17:58.050 --> 00:17:59.720
Sir, I must ask you to please leave.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.720
--What foah!? I'm Zenjiro!
--Go home, Mister!
--I can't see!

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:04.060
--I haven't heard of you. Please leave.
--Your teeth are in my way!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:07.060
Come on, everyone,
stop wearing such gloomy faces.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:11.060
We have to enjoy life! Let's forget
all the bad things and dance!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:15.070
Forget about the bad things, huh?
That's it, Sana-chan, hang in there!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.860
She's just following the script, dummy.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.490
As for her mother...

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.080
♪ My daughter Sana is now on stage, ♪

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.080
♪ All alone, all alone,
she's getting along, hoy! ♪

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.080
♪ The book is coming out, coming out,
coming out tomorrow. ♪

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:33.000
♪ Tomorrow, it's coming out, coming out,
the book is coming out. ♪

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.170
♪ It's coming out, I tell you,
it's coming out, ♪

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.670
♪ I tell you, coming out, coming out! ♪

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:39.680
The play continues!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.680
Eucie-sama! It's Tom! It's Tom!

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.680
Tom?

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.020
Tom!

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:49.350
Ah, Tom is dead! He was
killed by the military!

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.770
Tom! Tom! Wake up!

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.020
Poor Tom...

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:58.990
Magnificent, Sana-chan! Her brilliance
comes naturally to her.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.360
She's completely unlike
the other children.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.700
Father!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.700
Eucie was mistaken!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:06.700
All I've ever done was try to run
away from difficulty and sorrow,

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.660
but there are indeed times
when you have to fight back,

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:11.380
even when it is difficult,
and even when it hurts.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:14.380
--I realize that now!
--Ah, Sana-chan, incredible!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.800
But I don't want to
forget how to smile.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:20.050
My smile gives me strength!
The strength to save many people!

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:23.050
Everyone, stand up,
and overcome this sorrow!

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:25.720
Take each other's hands...
take each other's hands, please!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:30.730
--Smile...!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.020
--Don't forget to smile!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:36.020
You're really...
you're really amazing, Sana-chan!

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:38.030
What about you?

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:42.030
Is there something you're working
hard at, like Sana-chan is?

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.370
Oh.

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:45.700
Nope.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.620
Then you won't be a
good match for Sana-chan.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:57.050
Thank you so much for attending
today's Gekidan Komawari production.

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:01.720
And now, we would like
our special guest...

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:02.720
I'm awn!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:06.470
...Kamura Naozumi-kun, to present
our lead, Kurata Sana-San,

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:08.060
with a bouquet of flowers.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:09.890
I'm getting sick of this anime!

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.060
I didn't hear anything about this.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:17.520
And now, Kamura Naozumi-kun,
please come to the stage.

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.160
"Infuriating!!"

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:39.670
Ah, it's no use. Sana-chan and Kamura-kun
are surrounded by fans and the press.

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.340
There's no way we can get near them.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.180
How about we call it a day?

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:49.010
--Terrific! That was magnificent!
--Hello? It's me, Zenjiro.
Can I come ov-uh today?

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:52.020
No? But I just had my hawt broken.
Please?

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:55.690
Why nawt? It's going to take a lawt
to fix my broken hawt, aft-uh today.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.310
--Whoops. Oh dear, oh dear.
--Ah'm appearing in this anime

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:58.690
--My button has popped off.
--that is treating me something awful.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.030
--Hayama-kun, would you
pick that up for me?
--You want to break up?

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:02.030
What are you tawlking about?

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:04.360
Ah, thank you, thank you.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:09.330
That's a button shaped like Babbit.
What do you think? Pretty nice, huh?

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.830
Akito-kun, what are you doing!?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.710
Chop!!

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:22.050
...is what it looks like,
and then, bu-chaa!

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:27.640
Akito-kun, stop that!

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:32.060
Hayama-kun...

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:35.390
Why don't you take up karate?

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:40.400
As it happens, a friend of mine
is opening up a new branch dojo.

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.940
He's looking for some students.
What do you think?

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:45.030
Would you like to give it a try?

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.120
That's silly, Principal.

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:53.750
There's no way Akito-kun would do
anything that takes that kind of resolve.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:54.750
I'll do it.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:57.080
There, you see? Huh? You'll do it!?

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:59.750
Is that so, is that so?

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:00.750
Don't rub my head.

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:05.510
Huh? Akito-kun, why? Why would you?

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:20.610
It's over. The play...
summer vacation...

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:27.320
The play is over now, but the
pounding of my heart won't stop.

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:31.160
The next heart-pounder is coming.

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:34.580
Tomorrow, at last... at last,
the book will be coming out...

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.710
The second act is about to begin.

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:42.170
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:47.670
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:52.430
In dire straits,

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:56.020
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:59.900
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:04.980
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.190 --> 00:23:11.030
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:13.240
...panic!!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:19.080
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:21.750
he's there.

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:25.050
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:27.630
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:30.130
...for two.

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:33.600
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:38.350
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.270 --> 00:23:41.940
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:46.650
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.570 --> 00:23:52.240
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:54.910
he's there,

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:03.210
...for two.

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:10.840
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:12.090
Mama's book is finally published!

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:14.220
The press is raising a great uproar
over it, while others are left speechless.

00:24:14.220 --> 00:24:15.430
The mixed response comes quickly,

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.760
while the quick brown fox
jumps over the lazy dog!

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:21.100
All I want to know is how Mama feels.
And yet, Hayama is acting cold!

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:24.100
But then, he was never a
warm person to begin with.

00:24:24.100 --> 00:24:28.110
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 17;
the fated series finally reaches its climax!

00:24:28.110 --> 00:24:31.780
Ah, What a Surprise! Mama's Book

00:24:31.780 --> 00:24:33.740
Surprises, hiccups,
and butt-shaped rice cakes!

00:24:33.740 --> 00:24:35.200
We hope you look forward to it.
